[00:02.85] On the 14th day of April of 1935
[00:10.10] There struck the worst of dust storms that ever filled the sky
[00:16.81] You could see that dust storm comin'
[00:20.34] The cloud looked deathlike black
[00:23.60] And through our mighty nation it left a dreadful track
